    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teamcrafter</strong> is a crafting and gathering <strong>Roguelite!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like risking your life, fighting big monsters to save people you don't even know? Of course not, you'd be crazy, right!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teamcrafter is an idea born from all the years spent on <strong>FFXIV Teamcraft</strong>, watching numerous crafters prepare big equipment for adventurers fighting, living their cozy life in nature, gathering resources, playing the way they wanted to play, while helping others, in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An infinite number of worlds to visit</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore procedural biomes, caves, plains, forests, swamps, deserts, snowy mountains, windy places, magical caves, lava worlds, and much more\u2026</strong><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/572145231846de9e19eb1e8482bc166a.poster.avif?t=1754398225\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/572145231846de9e19eb1e8482bc166a.webm?t=1754398225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/572145231846de9e19eb1e8482bc166a.mp4?t=1754398225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay to the infinity! More than a hundred collectables, over 40 talents, 50 passive items, even run is different, and it's just the beginning!</strong><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/10b70270f5ccb6fca4f2c913b8bd67b3.poster.avif?t=1754398225\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/10b70270f5ccb6fca4f2c913b8bd67b3.webm?t=1754398225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/10b70270f5ccb6fca4f2c913b8bd67b3.mp4?t=1754398225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic fights with flashy spells, epic attacks, inspired from old JRPGs mixed with modern aethetics. Enjoy an automated turn-by-turn combat system with everything you need to monitor the fight, your party and help them succeed!</strong><br><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/03b67d283d722da05fef3575db1419eb.poster.avif?t=1754398225\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/03b67d283d722da05fef3575db1419eb.webm?t=1754398225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/03b67d283d722da05fef3575db1419eb.mp4?t=1754398225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teamcrafter</strong> is a crafting and gathering <strong>Roguelite!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you like risking your life, fighting big monsters to save people you don't even know? Of course not, you'd be crazy, right!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teamcrafter is an idea born from all the years spent on <strong>FFXIV Teamcraft</strong>, watching numerous crafters prepare big equipment for adventurers fighting, living their cozy life in nature, gathering resources, playing the way they wanted to play, while helping others, in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An infinite number of worlds to visit</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore procedural biomes, caves, plains, forests, swamps, deserts, snowy mountains, windy places, magical caves, lava worlds, and much more\u2026</strong><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/572145231846de9e19eb1e8482bc166a.poster.avif?t=1754398225\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/572145231846de9e19eb1e8482bc166a.webm?t=1754398225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/572145231846de9e19eb1e8482bc166a.mp4?t=1754398225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay to the infinity! More than a hundred collectables, over 40 talents, 50 passive items, even run is different, and it's just the beginning!</strong><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/10b70270f5ccb6fca4f2c913b8bd67b3.poster.avif?t=1754398225\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/10b70270f5ccb6fca4f2c913b8bd67b3.webm?t=1754398225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/10b70270f5ccb6fca4f2c913b8bd67b3.mp4?t=1754398225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic fights with flashy spells, epic attacks, inspired from old JRPGs mixed with modern aethetics. Enjoy an automated turn-by-turn combat system with everything you need to monitor the fight, your party and help them succeed!</strong><br><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/03b67d283d722da05fef3575db1419eb.poster.avif?t=1754398225\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/03b67d283d722da05fef3575db1419eb.webm?t=1754398225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405680/extras/03b67d283d722da05fef3575db1419eb.mp4?t=1754398225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Fighting dangerous beasts, this ain't for you. You're living the peaceful life, armed with your tools and your craftsmanship, you're here to create weapons, armors, accessories to help adventurers win and risk their life. Everybody knows how to fight, but you, you know how to craft!",
